        "value": "刎步ニ　内引千百六拾七石三斗八升四合六勺　永捨年限捨共"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "刎歩に　内引　千百六十七石三斗八升四合六勺（永捨・年限捨共）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Deducted from the combined assessment: 1,167.3846 koku, covering both permanent write-offs and write-offs granted for a fixed term; the small side-note 刎步ニ marks the figure as the struck-off share. Subtracting this from 14,018.676 koku yields 12,851.2914 koku, whereas the balance printed in the next column is 13,851.2914 koku — the sub-koku places agree exactly, so the printed page carries a 1,000-koku inconsistency between these two lines."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "内引"
